  "instructions": [
    "Rinse toor dal until the water runs clear.",
    "Heat oil in the lazy susan spinner, add cumin and mustard seeds, and let them pop.",
    "Add turmeric, coriander, garam masala, dried chili, and ginger; sauté for 30 seconds.",
    "Add rinsed dal and water, stir, cover, and set the spinner to high for 45 minutes.",
    "When halfway through, fold in collard greens and stir well.",
    "Let the dish rest 5 minutes after cooking before opening the lid.",
    "Season with salt, give a final stir, and serve hot."
  ],
